    intent "Avoid allocating per-region ForwardScratch buffers when the parallel cover scorer reads a completed immutable candidate cache. The lazy hierarchical path must retain its reusable transform buffers; only the completed-cache path may use zero-capacity scratch because CoverForwardBank::Complete never performs a forward transform. Retain only if canonical streams and decoder behavior remain unchanged and a pinned comparison shows neutral or improved target-rate speed."
