        Build the lossless modular effort ramp (speed/size dial) per Encoder-plan1.md §12. Reoriented by measurement: the full search is chaff on real photos, earning zero bytes for 16× the wall time. Prune the default path: flip Effort::DEFAULT to the lean level 1, demote the full search to opt-in, keep level 7 as the byte-identical density anchor.
        """
